owned": 412, "num_reviews": 110, "playtime_forever": 4567, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4490, "last_played": 1769467281, "avatar": "b4c98f6fe52e999f0770989fa62bb0976ca488ed"}, "language": "english", "review": "Yeah it's pretty good", "timestamp_created": 1765840472, "timestamp_updated": 1765840472, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "213384237", "author": {"steamid": "76561198292291820", "personaname": "Bammski", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Bammski/", "num_games_owned": 423, "num_reviews": 35, "playtime_forever": 3386, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2774, "last_played": 1786769598, "avatar": "74a45d5ed904372713ce0f5ade8b263fbf098a61"}, "language": "english", "review": "Nightreign is a very fun co-op souls game. It blends the best elements from elden ring and other fromsoft games. It's fast pace nature keeps the game entertaining and with it being a rougelite it makes every run feel unique. The dlc falls a bit short for what I wanted with more content but hopefully if they make more they can take all the criticism they got from forsaken hollows and make more packed dlcs. Overall if you're a souls fan you'll enjoy this game, but I'd say definitely buy this game on a sale since the rougelite elements might turn some people off since it's not traditional souls. 7.5/10", "timestamp_created": 1765839415, "timestamp_updated": 1765839582, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "213382244", "author": {"steamid": "76561198134416142", "personaname": "Monster", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198134416142/", "num_games_owned": 247, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 14308, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 279, "last_played": 1772703012, "avatar": "3d2fd909cc3de7f1ab64094c6d47f8ece587ebc9"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fromsoft Even does rougelite well. Amazing game!", "timestamp_created": 1765836986, "timestamp_updated": 1765836986, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "213380128", "author": {"steamid": "76561198247832468", "personaname": "HIT LORE", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198247832468/", "num_games_owned": 327, "num_reviews": 92, "playtime_forever": 6424, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5151, "last_played": 1781607725, "avatar": "0244904b8ec48f9e0355506d7bd5cd953385f20d"}, "language": "english", "review": "My favorite part of the souls games were always the Co-op, I loved putting down signs and getting summoned. So this game is pretty peak to me. It has a nice list of bosses, although, the map stays the same which is repetitive, but they added a new one recently (it sucks). A handful of champs too. IT handles very differently than normal souls games though, everything happens much quicker. The most important thing is to be fast.", "timestamp_created": 1765834482, "timestamp_updated": 1765834584, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_durin