/steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198987810967/", "num_games_owned": 116, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 3264, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2749, "last_played": 1781198335, "avatar": "1df3535a6f4c9bcf76d310fff46700d18b98412c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very fun game with amazing bosses. I just wish it was a little more challenging.", "timestamp_created": 1765826685, "timestamp_updated": 1765826685, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "213371624", "author": {"steamid": "76561197965905874", "personaname": "KεN_SchWarZ", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197965905874/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 3984, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2020, "last_played": 1767647866, "avatar": "7cf825ebd334af1e28b6c3f71790f88205a4a7b8"}, "language": "english", "review": "Meh, the game has NOTHING to do with skill, just pure dumb luck. if you can even call it that...If you liked OG EldenRing, you probably aren't going to be a fan of this one...Imagine ALL the worst things about past souls games, and lump them ALL into one game, NightReign is the outcome.", "timestamp_created": 1765825449, "timestamp_updated": 1767210528, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.472345560789108276", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "213370964", "author": {"steamid": "76561198894844457", "personaname": "toma.tomov99", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198894844457/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 1304, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 722, "last_played": 1771092756, "avatar": "0db5a1753618379d3505db7b2aea7beefaf935ba"}, "language": "english", "review": "Too many mechanics of the game are made specifically to annoy you and not to test your skill. For example to make a way to enter the area of the nightrain with the stupid eagle when its already the 3rd stage and to just die without the option to cancel it is simply anti-player. I also think that when you're playing solo, there should be a way to find a horse but maybe I haven't found it yet. Anyways a solid souls game with ♥♥♥♥♥♥ battleroyal mechanics.", "timestamp_created": 1765824739, "timestamp_updated": 1765824739, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.433070838451385498", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "213368614", "author": {"steamid": "76561198842471843", "personaname": "Deluxe", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/quiet_kidd/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 10283, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4728, "last_played": 1789218916, "avatar": "0748b361d703631139739712181c152421dbc00e"}, "language": "english", "review": "I hate Guardian:\ndisabled person's step insted of roll\nworst starting weapon\nuseless skill\nuseless ult\nugly\n\ngame is greate btw :)", "timestamp_created": 1765822333, "timestamp_updated": 1768062930, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_d